{
  "$comment": [
    "message.send 帧的黄金样本 — 前端与 Go 服务端共用的唯一契约来源。",
    "前端（packages/shared/src/__tests__/messageSendGolden.test.ts）驱动 messageStore 真的发一帧，",
    "把 chatSocket.send 收到的 payload 与本文件深比较；",
    "Go 侧（server/internal/ws/golden_contract_test.go）把同一份 payload 反序列化进 ws.SendPayload，",
    "跑 buildContent 并断言 ok=true 且 message_type 与 expected_message_type 一致。",
    "任一侧改字段名/类型/嵌套层级 → 两侧同时变红。",
    "此前两端各写一份'同构但独立'的断言，从未跑过同一份 JSON，改字段名照样双绿。",
    "约定：client_msg_id 是客户端随机生成的，故统一写成占位符 <client_msg_id>，",
    "前端比较前把实际值换成该占位符；Go 侧不校验其内容。",
    "conversation_id / reply_to_id / mentions / sticker_id 必须是合法 UUID（Go 侧按 uuid.UUID 解析）。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "text",
      "expected_message_type": 1,
      "frame": {
        "type": "message.send",
        "payload": {
          "conversation_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
          "content": { "type": "text", "text": "你好，golden" },
          "client_msg_id": "<client_msg_id>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "text_with_reply_and_mentions",
      "expected_message_type": 1,
      "frame": {
        "type": "message.send",
        "payload": {
          "conversation_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
          "content": { "type": "text", "text": "@张伟 看下这条" },
          "client_msg_id": "<client_msg_id>",
          "reply_to_id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
          "mentions": ["33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "image",
      "expected_message_type": 2,
      "frame": {
        "type": "message.send",
        "payload": {
          "conversation_id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
          "content": {
            "type": "image",
            "key": "images/2026/08/0f5a1c00-0001.jpg",
            "width": 800,
